{
    "word": "втайне",
    "lang_code": "ru",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "3bae91cd-d794-38b9-a721-6fbb534b01b0",
                "word": "втайне",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b304b39c-2a99-458b-8290-994c08b2ef4a",
                        "entry_id": "3bae91cd-d794-38b9-a721-6fbb534b01b0",
                        "tags": [
                            "canonical"
                        ],
                        "form": "вта́йне"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "197c99af-0528-3950-9d6a-f15c03fd244f",
                        "entry_id": "3bae91cd-d794-38b9-a721-6fbb534b01b0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "secretly (in secret)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9449012c-f692-4eae-a1c8-3cf68ef6845c",
                                "sense_id": "197c99af-0528-3950-9d6a-f15c03fd244f",
                                "text": "Он прикидывался то страстным охотником до лошадей, то отчаянным игроком, то самым тонким гастрономом; хотя никак не мог различить горской породы от арабской, никогда не помнил козырей и втайне предпочитал печеный картофель всевозможным изобретениям французской кухни.",
                                "translation": "At one time he pretended to be a passionate lover of horses, at another a desperate gambler, and at another a refined gourmet, although he was never able to distinguish the mountain breed from the Arab, could never remember the trump cards, and in secret preferred a baked potato to all the inventions of the French cuisine.",
                                "english": "At one time he pretended to be a passionate lover of horses, at another a desperate gambler, and at another a refined gourmet, although he was never able to distinguish the mountain breed from the Arab, could never remember the trump cards, and in secret preferred a baked potato to all the inventions of the French cuisine."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1fdba4e3-daaa-37bf-8af6-d55e2522efe5",
                "word": "втайне",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1865ce03-4447-30eb-98b6-be5b4562ec68",
                        "entry_id": "1fdba4e3-daaa-37bf-8af6-d55e2522efe5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "не обнаруживая, скрывая от других; тайно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6c8a19b-7dbd-4f46-8ec9-77fed39203de",
                                "sense_id": "1865ce03-4447-30eb-98b6-be5b4562ec68",
                                "text": "Совершено оно будет между солидными людьми втайне, и соблазна никому."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5effd08d-2e90-4712-a0d1-0890ef1aa2f5",
                                "sense_id": "1865ce03-4447-30eb-98b6-be5b4562ec68",
                                "text": "Из Сечи пришла весть, что татары, во время отлучки козаков, ограбили в ней всё, вырыли скарб, который втайне держали козаки под землёю, избили и забрали в плен всех, которые оставались, и со всеми забранными стадами и табунами направили путь прямо к Перекопу."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5eec83ac-cbb9-4be3-8960-f43d0f5f92f6",
                                "sense_id": "1865ce03-4447-30eb-98b6-be5b4562ec68",
                                "text": "Он был весьма ласков, услужлив, чувствителен и втайне сластолюбив, обладал приятным голосом, порядочно играл на фортепьяно и имел привычку, когда говорил с кем-нибудь, так и впиваться в него глазами."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2e9b4a9-936b-467f-9571-9cafc5360a7c",
                                "sense_id": "1865ce03-4447-30eb-98b6-be5b4562ec68",
                                "text": "Он втайне поклонялся чистоте женщины, признавал её власть и права и приносил ей жертвы."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "583939a7-6111-4eed-a84e-da60aca7b13f",
                        "source_entry_id": "1fdba4e3-daaa-37bf-8af6-d55e2522efe5",
                        "source_sense_id": "1865ce03-4447-30eb-98b6-be5b4562ec68",
                        "target_lang_word": "secretly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "secretly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa212b37-1bd2-3683-ac35-9914de12ec2b",
                                        "entry_id": "f750af24-1b9f-391b-bacc-1a1b741fa738",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In secret, covertly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "955eb3c7-3628-4239-b56d-95885089fe35",
                                                "sense_id": "fa212b37-1bd2-3683-ac35-9914de12ec2b",
                                                "text": "Mary cheated secretly in the test, and never got caught."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0700bdb5-d9fa-46ff-b7bd-e8349ca073f2",
                                                "sense_id": "fa212b37-1bd2-3683-ac35-9914de12ec2b",
                                                "text": "Sometimes her prose hyperventilates (\"Once, years ago, his and N.'s love for each other had glowed like phosphorescent fire on the surfaces of their bodies\"), and she has a weakness for epiphanies (\"There was a man, no longer young, though not yet old, who, traveling alone in northern Europe, began to feel that his soul was being drained slowly, almost secretly from him, drop by drop\")."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ad2b02d6-bb66-4d46-9b22-91605609ceba",
                        "source_entry_id": "1fdba4e3-daaa-37bf-8af6-d55e2522efe5",
                        "source_sense_id": "1865ce03-4447-30eb-98b6-be5b4562ec68",
                        "target_lang_word": "stealthily",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "stealthily",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06807067-8591-3619-a031-483a788f954b",
                                        "entry_id": "78bb9ecb-388d-3e6e-8715-e6e77961026e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a stealthy manner, furtively."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "796ff500-915d-4a3d-be6e-a0bba09abe23",
                                                "sense_id": "06807067-8591-3619-a031-483a788f954b",
                                                "text": "The dog obeyed the significant beck of his finger, and they drew off, stealthily, together."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52d5ac8f-3791-483f-8436-773568419032",
                                                "sense_id": "06807067-8591-3619-a031-483a788f954b",
                                                "text": "So intent was he upon this personal appraisement of his features that he did not hear the parting of the tall grass behind him as a great body pushed itself stealthily through the jungle; nor did his companion, the ape, hear either, for he was drinking and the noise of his sucking lips and gurgles of satisfaction drowned the quiet approach of the intruder."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dc51727b-5a16-4073-8339-8e8da376f7d9",
                        "source_entry_id": "1fdba4e3-daaa-37bf-8af6-d55e2522efe5",
                        "source_sense_id": "1865ce03-4447-30eb-98b6-be5b4562ec68",
                        "target_lang_word": "in secret",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "in secret",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd28e4c7-2034-3a37-96d6-b1a32775c8c2",
                                        "entry_id": "7ccfb87b-2a48-3b51-a27e-683c77dcff8a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "secretly; confidentially; in private."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55036037-7036-4b87-9727-3f4c19fd424f",
                                                "sense_id": "cd28e4c7-2034-3a37-96d6-b1a32775c8c2",
                                                "text": "The meeting took place in secret."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f833c9ce-e9c3-473e-a267-ae30612c8bbd",
                                                "sense_id": "cd28e4c7-2034-3a37-96d6-b1a32775c8c2",
                                                "text": "They reviewed the report in secret."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b882b806-4ccb-4383-90ed-2ffdf138561e",
                        "source_entry_id": "1fdba4e3-daaa-37bf-8af6-d55e2522efe5",
                        "source_sense_id": "1865ce03-4447-30eb-98b6-be5b4562ec68",
                        "target_lang_word": "secrètement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "secrètement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d03620d-ef9c-3845-adfb-b95de349d7ee",
                                        "entry_id": "996474ed-cf1d-3758-8bb7-fe991b662454",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière secrète ; à l’insu de tout le monde."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac6f1b76-bd40-42fa-b4d9-fc92145854cf",
                                                "sense_id": "6d03620d-ef9c-3845-adfb-b95de349d7ee",
                                                "text": "Les colères entassées fermentant dans le silence depuis vingt ans, grondaient de toutes parts ; la pensée se déchaînait, les livres qui d’ordinaire n’entraient en France que secrètement, commençaient à s’éditer à Paris."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8182fb03-1d2a-4168-ac06-730dd974bf7e",
                                                "sense_id": "6d03620d-ef9c-3845-adfb-b95de349d7ee",
                                                "text": "Ce ministre [Richelieu] se crut obligé de l’élever [Mazarin] à la pourpre ; par là il sembla montrer son successeur à la France, et le cardinal Mazarin s'avançait secrètement à la première place,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45af0320-5b42-49c3-a2e7-e8f3c94353eb",
                                                "sense_id": "6d03620d-ef9c-3845-adfb-b95de349d7ee",
                                                "text": "Elle attribuait les lenteurs de l'enquête secrètement poursuivie à la situation politique. On était en pleine période plébiscitaire. Il y avait chaque jour des troubles dans la rue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a1cce42-27de-4e66-91f3-99f980b54532",
                                                "sense_id": "6d03620d-ef9c-3845-adfb-b95de349d7ee",
                                                "text": "D’ailleurs son viel ami le notaire, sentant que la riche héritière épouserait nécessairement son neveu le président si Charles Grandet ne revenait pas, redoubla de soins et d’attentions : il venait tous les jours se mettre aux ordres de Grandet, allait à son commandement à Froidfond, aux terres, aux prés, aux vignes, vendait les récoltes, et transmutait tout en or et en argent qui venait se réunir secrètement aux sacs empilés dans le cabinet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3233b684-04ce-3144-ba43-f1dab5d989df",
                                        "entry_id": "996474ed-cf1d-3758-8bb7-fe991b662454",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dans le fond du cœur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8596cd76-be2e-42a6-8926-dede913d3136",
                                                "sense_id": "3233b684-04ce-3144-ba43-f1dab5d989df",
                                                "text": "Ces idoles [les grands] que le monde adore, à combien de tentations délicates ne sont-elles pas exposées ?… ne s'adorent-elles pas secrètement ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df569066-508a-4ebb-bb41-5d374bdafd55",
                        "source_entry_id": "1fdba4e3-daaa-37bf-8af6-d55e2522efe5",
                        "source_sense_id": "1865ce03-4447-30eb-98b6-be5b4562ec68",
                        "target_lang_word": "en secret",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "en secret",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ccf4970a-95cc-3c7e-a1f6-fda1a4469107",
                                        "entry_id": "ddec7dc3-3030-3fb5-be28-f21fd4731a36",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sans témoin, en se cachant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "943bab06-73ea-4102-858a-0dcce8de9df0",
                                                "sense_id": "ccf4970a-95cc-3c7e-a1f6-fda1a4469107",
                                                "text": "Je lui ai parlé en secret. Il ne travaille à cela qu’en secret. Ils se voient en secret."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc01c7f1-a1a9-32ce-b2c1-d99b25d30efa",
                                        "entry_id": "ddec7dc3-3030-3fb5-be28-f21fd4731a36",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière secrète, cachée, dissimulée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86b8a29c-b164-4e37-a5ca-bf004b38a0ce",
                                                "sense_id": "dc01c7f1-a1a9-32ce-b2c1-d99b25d30efa",
                                                "text": "Il feint de l’aimer, mais en secret il le déteste."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "73191e0c-fd2c-4e60-87e6-7a71728ba3b4",
                        "source_entry_id": "1fdba4e3-daaa-37bf-8af6-d55e2522efe5",
                        "source_sense_id": "1865ce03-4447-30eb-98b6-be5b4562ec68",
                        "target_lang_word": "en cachette",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "en cachette",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "226d8760-505b-334c-87c7-47bcd70651e6",
                                        "entry_id": "313f273b-3a5d-3599-b8fd-8901bb6f0f6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En secret : à la dérobée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b087d0a3-5fd7-41dc-8572-ea38c70be093",
                                                "sense_id": "226d8760-505b-334c-87c7-47bcd70651e6",
                                                "text": "Souvenez-vous des paroles de nos pères théologiens, Hurtado de Mendoza et Sanchez, qui ont prouvé qu’on peut tuer en cachette son ennemi, puisque l’on évite par ce moyen deux péchés : celui d’exposer sa vie, et celui de se battre en duel. C’est d’après ce grand principe consolateur que j’ai toujours agi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "855bb94c-17d6-465d-8309-7b8d31491cdf",
                                                "sense_id": "226d8760-505b-334c-87c7-47bcd70651e6",
                                                "text": "Puisque j'arrivais à tenir et à diriger un porte-plume, pourquoi pas aussi un petit pinceau ? En cachette, j’essayai, je m’évertuai, j’éduquai mes doigts et mon poignet et j’arrivai à un résultat relativement satisfaisant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b80f6eb-22b2-440b-9ca4-26392a369a4e",
                                                "sense_id": "226d8760-505b-334c-87c7-47bcd70651e6",
                                                "text": "– Demande à papa. Dis-lui que c’est pour acheter des cigarettes et que tu les lui demandes en cachette de maman, il te les donnera."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08475ea3-fa0c-426f-bc32-3cc907a16fcd",
                                                "sense_id": "226d8760-505b-334c-87c7-47bcd70651e6",
                                                "text": "Elle buvait en cachette tandis que vous vous écriviez, en cachette aussi, un livre sur ce drame."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
